A full internal transfer infers the destination basis without inventing a trade price.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:Other
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  4 FUND {100 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -400 SEK

2024-01-02 Transfer all units
  Assets:Broker  -4 FUND {{400 SEK}}
  Assets:Other  4 FUND

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 Purchase
    Assets:Broker                       4 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Cash                          -400.00 SEK

2024-01-02 Transfer all units
    Assets:Broker                       -4 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Other                        4 FUND {100.00 SEK}

========== WARNINGS ==========

